<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en-US'><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><script>window['ec:pageId']='1183814120953413275'</script><title>CFP</title><link href="/images/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/jpeg"/><link href="/css/cool.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/cfp/classic.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/menu_cfp.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/js/easy.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=545"></script><script>EC.version='545'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">ICAIGC 2027: 2027 IEEE International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and Generated Content</div><div id="cfpvenue"></div><div id="cfpdateplace">Melaka, Malaysia, August 14-16, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://www.icaigc.net" target="_blank">https://www.icaigc.net</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icaigc2027" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icaigc2027</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>February 20, 2027</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=179599" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkred bg_yellow">content creation</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=77181" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_violet bg_green">generative models</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=18207345" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_bluelight bg_seagreenlight">multimodal understanding</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=1294922" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_carmin bg_wheat">interdisciplinary applications</span></a></div><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">ICAIGC 2027 brings together researchers, engineers, and practitioners to share the latest advances in Artificial Intelligence and Generated Content (AIGC). In recent years, generative artificial intelligence and large-scale foundation models have achieved remarkable breakthroughs, profoundly transforming industries, scientific research, and creative workflows. As AIGC technologies rapidly evolve into a core driver of digital innovation, addressing key challenges in multimodal learning, model robustness, security, and ethical deployment becomes increasingly vital.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Organized by Multimedia University and Universiti Sains Malaysia (USM), and to be held in the historic city of Melaka, Malaysia from August 14–16, 2027, ICAIGC 2027 provides an exceptional international platform for academic exchange, technological exploration, and industry collaboration. We warmly welcome researchers, scholars, and industry professionals from around the globe to submit their original work, share visionary insights, and join us in shaping the future of artificial intelligence and generated content.</span></span></p><h2>Submission GuidelinesSubmission GuidelinesSubmission Guidelines</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Academic Ethics &amp; Publication Integrity</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">ICAIGC 2027 is committed to the highest standards of academic integrity. All submissions and publications are expected to adhere to the following principles:</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Originality &amp; No Plagiarism</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Submissions must be original and must not have been published or be under review elsewhere. Plagiarism, including self-plagiarism and verbatim reuse without citation, is strictly prohibited and will lead to immediate rejection.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">No Multiple or Concurrent Submissions</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">A manuscript may be submitted to only one venue at a time. Submitting the same work to multiple conferences or journals simultaneously constitutes a serious ethical violation.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Authorship &amp; Contribution</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Authorship should reflect substantial intellectual contribution. All listed authors must approve the final manuscript, and the corresponding author is responsible for ensuring accuracy and consent.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Conflicts of Interest</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Authors, reviewers and editors must disclose any financial, professional or personal conflicts of interest that could influence the review or publication process.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Ethical Use of Data &amp; AI</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Research involving human subjects, personal data, or generative models must respect privacy, consent and applicable regulations. Appropriate approvals and reproducibility of results are expected.</span></span></p><h2>List of TopicsList of TopicsList of Topics</h2><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Generative AI and Foundation Models</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Large Language Models (LLMs) and Alignment</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Diffusion, Flow and Score-based Generative Models</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Autoregressive and Energy-Based Generative Models</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Self-Supervised and Representation Learning for Generation</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Model Scaling Laws and Architectural Innovations</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Advanced Neural Network Architectures for Synthesis</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Model Compression, Distillation and Pruning</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Efficient Training and Optimization Strategies</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Theoretical Foundations of Generative Adversarial Networks</span></span></li><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">...</span></span></li></ul><h2>CommitteesCommitteesCommittees</h2><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Conference Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Tee Connie, Multimedia University</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Putra Sumari, Universiti Sains Malaysia</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Conference Co-Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Suresh Ponnan, Vel Tech Rangarajan Dr. Sagunthala R&amp;D Institute of Science and Technolog</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Vairavel G, SRM institute of Science &amp; Technology (SRMIST), Tiruchirappalli Campus</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Program Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Ong Thian Song, Multimedia University</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Wong Wai Kit, Multimedia University</span></span></p><h2>PublicationPublicationPublication</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">All accepted and registered papers will be published in the ICAIGC 2027 Conference Proceedings, and submitted for indexing in major international databases including EI Compendex and Scopus.</span></span></p><h2>ContactContactContact</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Conference Secretary: Miss. Fiona</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Tel.: +001-6193091099 (Mon–Fri, 09:00–18:00 UTC+08:00)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Email: icaigc2027@secretariat.org</span></span></p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
